  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Complex changes in seasonal and annual CO2 exchange with changes in hydrology can be simulated with models that represent basic processes for soil-plant atmosphere transfers of gases, particularly O2, as well as those of water and energy. Such models can provide a predictive capability for how arctic productivity might change with hydrology under future climates."
